## Third-party dataset notice

The MIT notice above applies to original project code and documentation. It
does not replace the terms for third-party material that may be included in
the CSV or saved notebook outputs. The notes below preserve the available
dataset attribution information.
### Dataset attribution

The included CSV has 858 records and 36 fields, matching the structure
described for UCI's Cervical Cancer (Risk Factors) dataset. The local file's
exact provenance and transformations are not recorded. The UCI record credits
Kelwin Fernandes, Jaime Cardoso, and Jessica Fernandes (2017), and assigns
DOI https://doi.org/10.24432/C5Z310.
### Dataset license

UCI lists the Cervical Cancer (Risk Factors) dataset under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International license. Review its terms at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. If this CSV is derived from that
dataset, retain its attribution and license information when sharing it.
### Notebook outputs

The notebook contains saved tabular outputs derived from the included data.
Those outputs may carry the same attribution obligations as the source data.
The MIT license does not independently relicense patient-level records or
third-party dataset material.
### Provenance limits

The repository does not document a checksum or transformation history for
the local CSV. Confirm its source and changes before redistributing a copy
or making claims that it is byte-identical to the UCI release.
